{"root":"pli/ms","translators":["sujato"],"title":"Gosāla","html":"<article id='thag1.23'><header><ul><li class='division'><span class='root'>Theragāthā 1.23 </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Verses of the Senior Monks 1.23 </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Ekakanipāta </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Book of the Ones </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Tatiyavagga </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Chapter Three </span></li></ul>\n<h1 class='sutta-title'><span class='root'>Gosālattheragāthā </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Gosāla </span></h1></header>\n<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>“Ahaṁ kho veḷugumbasmiṁ, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>I’ll eat honey and milk-rice </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>bhutvāna madhupāyasaṁ; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>in Veḷugumba. </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Padakkhiṇaṁ sammasanto, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>And then, dexterously probing </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>khandhānaṁ udayabbayaṁ; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>the rise and fall of the aggregates, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Sānuṁ paṭigamissāmi, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>I’ll return to my forest hill </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>vivekamanubrūhayan”ti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>and foster seclusion. </span></span></p></blockquote>\n<p class='endsutta'><span class='root'>… Gosālo thero …. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p></article>"}
